	"intro": [
		{
			"text": "<highlight>Info</highlight>"
		},
		{
			"text": "You can not buy ready-made houses. You have to build them using tradeskills."
		},
		{
			"text": "The store where all this is sold is Uncle Bazzit's Shop in Meetmedere (MMD)."
		},
		{
			"text": "There are two types of buildings: advanced and regular ones. To make an advanced building you need to upgrade your #L \"Regular Building Structure\" \"254807\"."
		},
		{
			"text": "The QL of the building ranges from 1-300 and is determined by #L \"Generic Organic Immunity System\" \"254822\"."
		},
		{
			"text": "Uncle Bazzit only sells up to QL75. To find out how to make a higher QL, look further down in this guide."
		},
		{
			"text": "Advanced structures: Headquarter, Market, Guard House"
		},
		{
			"text": "Regular Structures: Grid House, Notum Mining Operations, Notum Silo, Landing Pad, Satellite Uplink, ECM Tower, Swimming Pool, Sidewalk Cafe, Sky Bar"
		},
		{
			"text": ""
		},
		{
			"text": "Note: for a building of QL75+ you will need to build your own Generic Organic Immunity System and will also need:"
		},
